(6072502, 837374, 97270, '<td valign="top">Love the grain. Love the Sepia-n feel. Love her look, and love her gesture. I may not be qualified to comment on the tilt-shift aspect of it, but I like the image, It made me look at the screen for longer than 3 seconds, which is rare. I may have cropped it to exclude the edge of the seat to the right though. Otherwise, brilliant!<br/> <br/>[<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1014133" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">The Comment or die game thread</a>]</td>', 'Love the grain. Love the Sepia-n feel. Love her look, and love her gesture. I may not be qualified to comment on the tilt-shift aspect of it, but I like the image, It made me look at the screen for longer than 3 seconds, which is rare. I may have cropped it to exclude the edge of the seat to the right though. Otherwise, brilliant! [The Comment or die game thread]', '2010-06-28 20:00:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6167005, 837391, 83544, '<td valign="top">These tilt shift photos make me feel like a kid again. I just wanna jump right there and play with those "little: trucks and cars :) Great capture</td>', 'These tilt shift photos make me feel like a kid again. I just wanna jump right there and play with those "little: trucks and cars :) Great capture', '2010-09-20 09:01:58.000000', NULL, 0),
